    <meta name="description" content="Haitao Zheng, also known as Zheng Haitao, 郑海涛, 鄭海濤, Tao, Jensen Zheng, and Jensen Zane, is a Cyber Security & Privacy student building security tooling, cloud log analysis projects, IOC workflows, technical articles, and static-first web systems.">
    <meta name="keywords" content="Haitao Zheng, Zheng Haitao, 郑海涛, 鄭海濤, Tao Zheng, Tao, Jensen Zheng, Jensen Zane, jensenzheng, jensenzane, Haitao Zheng cyber security, Haitao Zheng cybersecurity, 郑海涛 网络安全, 鄭海濤 網路安全, cyber security, cybersecurity portfolio, cloud security, blue team, IOC toolkit, security tooling, technical articles, developer portfolio, GitHub portfolio, Astro portfolio, Cloudflare Pages, Cyber Security Deutschland, Cybersecurity Germany, Cloud-Sicherheit, IT-Sicherheit">
