    `<p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl rounded-2xl border border-sky-300/20 bg-sky-300/5 px-4 py-3 text-xs text-sky-100/90 font-mono leading-relaxed shadow-[0_0_34px_rgba(125,211,252,0.08)]">
